WEBVTT

00:05:29.283 --> 00:05:33.496
And with one microphone you'll hear
Pher's beautiful, natural voice.

00:05:33.871 --> 00:05:37.124
(Pher vocalizing)

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:39.919
(Audience cheers)

00:05:40.586 --> 00:05:41.837
And with this microphone,

00:05:41.879 --> 00:05:45.800
you'll hear a live version of Holly+
developed with Voctro Labs.

00:05:48.219 --> 00:05:51.722
(Pher vocalizing in Holly+ voice)

00:05:52.431 --> 00:05:56.977
(Laughter and applause)

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.021
Take it away Pher.